  "content": "\n\n<h1>免燃附魔</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> \n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fburnless-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/burnless-enchantment-data-pack?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> \n<a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"License\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p><code>免燃</code> 是一款針對護甲的全新附魔，能夠減少你的燃燒時間。為全套護甲附魔「免燃」後，任何燃燒效果將瞬間消失！</p>\n<p>此附魔可透過附魔桌、戰利品寶箱或與村民交易獲得。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤/問題</h2>\n<p>請在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 回報任何問題或錯誤。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>給予：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot burnless_enchantment:burnless</code></pre>\n<p>附魔：</p>\n<pre><code>/enchant @s burnless_enchantment:burnless</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/enchantments-data-pack/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🎁 伺服器託管</h2>\n<p>建立自己的伺服器可能是一個非常耗時、繁瑣且昂貴的過程。</p>\n<p>但透過 BisectHosting，你只需點擊幾下就能擁有自己的伺服器！他們提供 24/7 客服支援與快速回應，絕不會讓任何問題阻礙你的腳步！有興趣嗎？我們為你準備了專屬優惠！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b542-3023cd08bdfe.webp\" alt=\"Server Hosting\"></p>",
